---
description: Rules for UI development and styling using Shadcn UI and Tailwind CSS, emphasizing responsive design and a mobile-first approach.
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use Shadcn UI, and Tailwind for components and styling.
- Follow semantic color tokens — see `color-theming.mdc`
- Implement responsive design with Tailwind CSS
- All shadcn components are available at src/components/ui folder
- **Colors:** follow `color-theming.mdc` — semantic Tailwind tokens only, no raw hex/hsl/oklch in TSX
- **Accessibility:** follow `accessibility-wcag.mdc` — WCAG 2.2 AA baseline on all UI